/target/
**/*.rs.bk

node_modules/
/shell/*/dist/

**/__pycache__/

/_build/
# Derived mockup renders, about 32 MB (`just design-render`).
/design/renders/
/out/
*.qcow2
*.raw
*.iso
*.oci/
# The RPMs image/Containerfile reads from the build context; `image.sh context` fills it.
/rpms/

# Private keys never belong in the repository: `cosign generate-key-pair` writes cosign.key next to cosign.pub.
cosign.key
*.key
*.key.bak

# Biometric data never belongs in the repository, in any letter case (docs/hardware/FINGERPRINT.md);
# privacy-guard.sh also fails on these names, and on the hex dumps and long lines no pattern catches.
*.[Pp][Gg][Mm]
*.[Vv][Aa][Rr][Ii][Aa][Nn][Tt]
*.[Ii][Oo][Cc][Tt][Ll]
*.[Uu][Mm][Oo][Cc][Kk][Dd][Ee][Vv]
*.[Pp][Cc][Aa][Pp]
*.[Pp][Cc][Aa][Pp][Nn][Gg]
**/var/lib/fprint/

.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
